<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Proposed model"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="1210" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="1210" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="reg" value="&lt;b&gt;Safety requirements (natural language)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EU Implementing Regulation 2022/1426, Annexes II and III&lt;br&gt;UN Regulation No 157 (ALKS), paragraphs 2, 5, 6 and 7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="20" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cor" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Requirements corpus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;441 verbatim statements with stable identifiers&lt;br&gt;(370 from EU 2022/1426; 71 from UN R157)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="140" width="560" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lib" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Formal ODD condition library&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;29 conditions: dimension, variable, operator, threshold, unit, response&lt;br&gt;ODD conditions | performance limits | boundary responses | activation&lt;br&gt;Threshold recorded only when the clause states it" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="250" width="560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pred" value="&lt;b&gt;3  Phase A: executable ODD boundary predicates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;P1 to P8, each a Boolean test on a scenario,&lt;br&gt;carrying the identifier of its source clause" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="380" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="space" value="&lt;b&gt;4  ODD scenario space and candidate pool&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6 dimensions (972 concrete scenarios); pool of n candidates, budget k" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="500" width="560" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="qubo" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Phase B: QUBO scenario selection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coverage-aligned objective: min  −Σ |Pi| xi + Σ |Pi ∩ Pj| xi xj + C(Σ xi − k)²&lt;br&gt;Solvers: QAOA (simulator / IBM Quantum), quantum annealing (D-Wave),&lt;br&gt;simulated annealing, genetic algorithm, greedy; sub-QUBO decomposition" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="610" width="560" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="osc" value="&lt;b&gt;6  Executable test scenarios&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ASAM OpenSCENARIO 1.1 files with ODD levels, predicates and source clauses" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="760" width="560" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sim" value="&lt;b&gt;7  Simulation-based execution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;esmini with the UN R157 ALKS controller (regulation / reference-driver models)&lt;br&gt;ODD degradation model (braking, sensing) and injected faults&lt;br&gt;Oracle: collision = FAIL (EU 2022/1426 Annex III 1.4.2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="870" width="560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eval" value="&lt;b&gt;8  Evaluation and traceability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coverage, fault detection, computational cost, statistical tests&lt;br&gt;Trace audit: result → scenario → predicate → condition → clause" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1000" width="560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="out" value="&lt;b&gt;Traceable, optimised verification evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;for ODD boundaries of automated driving systems" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1130" width="560" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tm" value="&lt;b&gt;Traceability matrix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;clause → condition → predicate&lt;br&gt;→ code representation (or gap)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="250" width="320" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq1" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Share of requirements mapped to a&lt;br&gt;traceable ODD boundary predicate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="380" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ref" value="&lt;b&gt;Reference optimum&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;exhaustive enumeration (n ≤ 20) or&lt;br&gt;integer linear programme (n &amp;gt; 20)&lt;br&gt;RQ2: coverage   RQ3: cost and scale" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="610" width="320" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq2" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fault detection of the selected&lt;br&gt;scenario sets in simulation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="870" width="320" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rq4" value="&lt;b&gt;RQ4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trace completeness and change&lt;br&gt;propagation after a requirement edit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;align=center;spacingLeft=6;arcSize=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="1000" width="320" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="chg" value="&lt;b&gt;requirement change&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;horizontal=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="21" y="560" width="18" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="reg" target="cor"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cor" target="lib"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lib" target="pred"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pred" target="space"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="space" target="qubo"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="qubo" target="osc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="osc" target="sim"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sim" target="eval"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSi